      "regions": [
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "header",
          "text": "FIELD NOTES · 便携手冲\n   便携手冲器具评测\n  \n  \n   站内搜索\n   \n    \n    搜索",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 0,
          "width": 1072,
          "height": 113.984375,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "2026 秋季实测 · 第 7 次修订\n  把一杯好咖啡，塞进背包的缝隙里\n  我们带着五款便携手冲器具，在早班地铁、青旅洗手台和海拔 1800 米的营地里各冲了三十杯。这份榜单不排“最强”，只回答一个问题：你的背包和口味，适合哪一只。\n  \n   实测 38 天\n   累计 150 杯\n   更新于 2026-11-07",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 113.984375,
          "width": 1072,
          "height": 356.65625,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "rank",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "编辑榜单\n     按“单位重量下的萃取稳定性”排序，不是价格排序；01–05 编号为编辑榜原序，不随排序变化。\n    \n    \n     筛选\n     按价格从低到高\n    \n    \n     \n      01\n      \n       AeroPress Go\n       \n        差旅\n        办公\n        压滤",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 508.640625,
          "width": 647.25,
          "height": 1386.984375,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "article",
          "text": "01\n      \n       AeroPress Go\n       \n        差旅\n        办公\n        压滤\n       \n       杯身即收纳盒，整套 330 g 塞进随行杯里，注水、搅拌、下压三步出杯。萃取厚实、容错率高，缺点是风味的细腻层次不如滤纸手冲。\n       \n        \n         \n   ",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 670.890625,
          "width": 647.25,
          "height": 226.546875,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "article",
          "text": "02\n      \n       Kalita Wave 155 不锈钢\n       \n        露营\n        新手\n        平底\n       \n       三孔蛋糕杯让水流均匀，容错率是五款里最高的，新手也很难冲出苦涩。不锈钢杯身耐磕碰，缺点是比树脂款重，专用滤纸也略贵一点。\n       \n        \n         ",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 897.4375,
          "width": 647.25,
          "height": 249.546875,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "article",
          "text": "03\n      \n       Wacaco Cuppamoka\n       \n        通勤\n        一体化\n        滴滤\n       \n       滴滤杯直接扣在 300 ml 保温杯上，出杯后能保温两小时。整机 336 g，通勤包里几乎占不出一格。清洗要拆三件，赶时间时会嫌它麻烦。\n       \n        \n   ",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 1146.984375,
          "width": 647.25,
          "height": 249.546875,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "article",
          "text": "04\n      \n       Hario V60 树脂滤杯 02\n       \n        通勤\n        性价比\n        轻量\n       \n       83 g 的单只滤杯，锥形单孔、流速快，风味明亮干净。它需要另配手冲壶与锥形滤纸，但整套算下来仍是五款里最便宜的方案。\n       \n        \n         \n ",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 1396.53125,
          "width": 647.25,
          "height": 249.546875,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "article",
          "text": "05\n      \n       Snow Peak 户外折叠滤杯\n       \n        露营\n        极简出行\n        折叠\n       \n       折叠后不到 3 cm 厚，可以塞进外套口袋。树脂材质不导热，出水略快，风味偏薄，适合当“第二只杯子”或极简出行时的备用方案。\n       \n        \n        ",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 1646.078125,
          "width": 647.25,
          "height": 249.546875,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "spec",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "规格对照\n     窄屏可横向滑动查完整表格\n    \n    \n     \n      \n       \n        器具\n        重量\n        单次容量\n        材质\n        收纳体积\n        萃取风格\n        参考价\n       \n      \n      \n       \n        Aero",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 1943.625,
          "width": 647.25,
          "height": 480.546875,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "guide",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "选购决策路径\n     四个问题，落到唯一一只\n    \n    不想读完两千字的话，按顺序回答下面四个问题，最后落到的名字就是答案。\n    展开四步决策\n    \n     \n      你愿意带磨豆机吗？不愿意 → 先解决豆子（预磨粉或挂耳），再谈器具，选定后回到第 2 步继续；愿意 → 进入第 2 步。\n      你更在意速度还是风味？速度 → 若",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 2472.171875,
          "width": 647.25,
          "height": 152.84375,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "method",
          "tag": "section",
          "text": "评测方法与常见问题\n     数据怎么来的，以及它测不出什么\n    \n    每款器具使用同一支手磨、同一批水洗中浅烘豆，粉水比 1:15，研磨度按各自推荐值微调。重量用厨房秤实测整机（含必要配件），容量为标注可冲煮上限。萃取表现由三位评测员盲测打分，只保留分歧小于 1 分的结论。我们不测量耐摔极限与长期老化，这两项只作使用体感描述。\n    \n     ",
          "x": 176.5,
          "y": 2673.015625,
          "width": 647.25,
          "height": 445.0625,
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "lineHeight": "27.52px",
          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, sans-serif",
          "horizontalScroll": null
        },
        {
          "id": "",
          "tag": "aside",
          "text": "快速结论\n    \n     通勤：V60 树脂 02 加一只保温杯，不到 100 g，69 元起步。\n     差旅：AeroPress Go，冲煮与收纳一套解决，酒店房间也能出杯。\n     露营：Kalita Wave 155 不锈钢，抗摔、容错最高。\n     极简出行：Snow Peak 折叠滤杯，折后 3 cm 塞进口袋。\n    \n    复制",
